The following files should have been installed by CNMP_INSTALL:

To your chosen CNMP install path..

	CNMP.guide (amigaguide Autodocs for CNMP)
	EasyRexx.doc
	EasyRexx.guide
	CNMP_Empty.c (empty programming shell for CNMP applications)

to libs:

	EasyRexx.library

to lib:

	EasyRexx.lib

to include:cnmp

	cnmp.o

to include/clib

	cnmp_protos.h
	easyrexx_protos.h

to include:libraries

	easyrexx.h

